          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ઉપાય — upāy — \"a way out\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "જો આ ઉપાય કામ કરશે તો તાવ જલદી ઊતરશે. jo ā upāy kām karśe to tāv jaldī ūtarśe. If this remedy works, the fever will soon come down."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "A masculine noun."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ઉપાય (upāy) is a tatsama, borrowed from Sanskrit upāya, \"coming near, a means, a way\" (Monier-Williams)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
